"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--others mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--cross\">\n              <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.0131 10.25L16.7384 5.52474C17.0872 5.17594 17.0872 4.61041 16.7384 4.26161C16.3896 3.9128 15.8241 3.9128 15.4753 4.26158L10.75 8.98687L6.02476 4.26161C5.67595 3.9128 5.11043 3.9128 4.76162 4.26161C4.41282 4.61041 4.41282 5.17594 4.76162 5.52474L9.48691 10.25L4.7616 14.9753C4.4128 15.3241 4.4128 15.8896 4.76162 16.2384C5.11043 16.5872 5.67595 16.5872 6.02476 16.2384L10.75 11.5131L15.4753 16.2384C15.8256 16.5856 16.3911 16.5831 16.7384 16.2328C17.0835 15.8847 17.0835 15.3234 16.7384 14.9753L12.0131 10.25Z\" fill=\"#E34E36\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-row\">\n            <div class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--feature\">\n              <p class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-feature-name\">Full Clinical Doses, No Fairy Dusting</p>\n              <p class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-feature-sub\">1,000mg Tongkat Ali + 1,000mg Fenugreek per serving</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--brand mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--check\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.45312 11.422L10.1852 16.8711L19.4998 6.46878\" stroke=\"#4FA250\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--others mpv1-dtv2__comparison-col--cross\">\n              <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria