    "pdp_tabs": {
      "type": "pdp-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_details": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Product Details",
            "heading": "WHAT UP MEN IS",
            "content": "<p>UP MEN is a men's dietary supplement with 9 active ingredients in each daily serving. It is designed to simplify the supplementation step inside a broader routine that can include nutrition, movement, training, sleep and consistent self-care.</p><p>Suggested use: take 5 capsules daily with food. The exact amount of every active ingredient is printed on the Supplement Facts panel.</p>",
            "jump_link": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_included": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "What's Included",
            "heading": "YOUR PLAN AND YOUR WELCOME KIT",
            "content": "<p>The <strong>90-day routine</strong> ships 3 bottles together and includes the Complete Welcome Kit: UP MEN Branded Thermal Bottle, UP MEN Crossbody Pack, Keychain Pill Case, Smart Activity Band and the UP MEN Men's Wellness Guide (digital, delivered by email).</p><p>The <strong>30-day routine</strong> ships 1 bottle with the Starter Welcome Kit: UP MEN Branded Thermal Bottle, Keychain Pill Case and the digital guide.</p><p>All physical welcome gifts ship with your first order. Welcome gifts are included once and are not repeated on renewals.</p>",
            "jump_link": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_subscription": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Subscription",
            "heading": "HOW BILLING WORKS",
            "content": "<p>The 90-day plan is charged at the $118 subscriber rate shown at checkout and renews at that same rate every 90 days unless you skip, pause or cancel before renewal. Each renewal contains 3 bottles of UP MEN only.</p><p>The 30-day plan is charged at $59 and renews every 30 days on the same terms.</p><p>To change or cancel a future renewal, contact UP MEN support before your next billing date. Review the Subscription Policy for complete terms.</p>",
            "jump_link": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_guarantee": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Guarantee",
            "heading": "90-DAY SATISFACTION GUARANTEE",
            "content": "<p>Your purchase is protected according to the terms of the published 90-day satisfaction guarantee. Review the <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a> for eligibility, deadlines, required steps and any conditions before ordering.</p>",
            "jump_link": ""
          }
        },
